example_edge_escaping.tmark.terminal_plain:
## Edge: escaping

Reserved characters: # { } \ should be escaped.

Semicolon ; stays literal; newlines
stay in text.

URL with braces and hash <https://example.com/search?q={tmark}#top>

┌─ code tmark
│ {document;
│ #url{u}
│ #title{t}
│ {p;raw-ish # text}
│ }
└─

