example_math_and_code.tmark.terminal_plain:
## Math and code

Inline formula ⟦\sqrt{a^2+b^2}⟧ and `const ok = true`.

math:
  \sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}

┌─ code go
│ type Example struct {
│     Name string `json:"name"`
│ }
│ 
│ func (e Example) Empty() bool {
│     return e.Name == ""
│ }
└─

┌─ code
│ line with #hash
│ line with {braces}
│ line with backslash \\
└─

